        "original_id": "f7865200-b770-521b-a427-a73e113ab4ce",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Shihad, Morningwood\n- People: Hayley Westenra\n- Companies: Capitol Records\n- Products: The General Electric\n- Topics: New Zealand music chart achievements, album releases\n\nFacts:\n- In October 1999, Shihad released The General Electric as their fourth album.\n- Morningwood was signed to Capitol Records and released two albums.\n- During their recording career, Shihad produced five number-one studio albums in New Zealand.\n- Shihad hold the title for the most number-one records by any New Zealand artist alongside Hayley Westenra.\n- Shihad also had three top-ten singles in New Zealand.",
